:"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":11,"text":"Mays was still third now followed by Nuvolari, who had decided to start after all. Nuvolari was driving flat out as usual, having already passed Seaman.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":24},{"lap":11,"text":"On lap 11 it was Rosemeyer's turn to take the lead, he and Caracciola having a tough fight and pulling away from the others.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":11,"text":"Mays was still third now followed by Nuvolari, who had decided to start after all. Nuvolari was driving flat out as usual, having already passed Seaman.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":24},{"lap":16,"text":"Nuvolari's engine throws a rod.","q":false,"c":24},{"lap":16,"text":"Nuvolari's engine throws a rod.","q":false,"c":24},{"lap":17,"text":"Caracciola was the next to retire with supercharger failure on lap 17.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":23},{"lap":17,"text":"Seaman had started to advance and the order was now Rosemeyer, Seaman, Mays, von Delius and Farina.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":17,"text":"Caracciola was the next to retire with supercharger failure on lap 17.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":23},{"lap":17,"text":"Seaman had started to advance and the order was now Rosemeyer, Seaman, Mays, von Delius and Farina.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":26,"text":"He passed Mays on lap 26; the two disputed second place for the next ten laps, until Mays' tyres gave out and he had to stop.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":1},{"lap":26,"text":"He passed Mays on lap 26; the two disputed second place for the next ten laps, until Mays' tyres gave out and he had to stop.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":1},{"lap":38,"text":"On lap 38 Rosemeyer made a 35 seconds pitstop for fuel and tyres, Seaman now being the new leader by 30 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":38,"text":"Mays stops for 78 seconds.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":38,"text":"On lap 38 Rosemeyer made a 35 seconds pitstop for fuel and tyres, Seaman now being the new leader by 30 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":38,"text":"Mays stops for 78 seconds.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":40,"text":"Farina hands his car to Nuvolari.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":40,"text":"Farina hands his car to Nuvolari.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":46,"text":"Rosemeyer pulled in Seaman's lead and caught the Mercedes just as Seaman pulled into the pits for his stop on lap 46.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":46,"text":"Rosemeyer pulled in Seaman's lead and caught the Mercedes just as Seaman pulled into the pits for his stop on lap 46.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":47,"text":"The order after the pitstops were: Rosemeyer, Seaman, Mays, von Delius, Nuvolari, Winn and Horn.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":47,"text":"The order after the pitstops were: Rosemeyer, Seaman, Mays, von Delius, Nuvolari, Winn and Horn.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":48,"text":"Nuvolari passes von Delius and then Mays.","q":false,"c":24},{"lap":48,"text":"Nuvolari passes von Delius and then Mays.","q":false,"c":24},{"lap":50,"text":"Nuvolari pits with the engine destroyed and hands the car back to Farina.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":50,"text":"Nuvolari pits with the engine destroyed and hands the car back to Farina.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":58,"text":"Unable to do so, on lap 58 he handed the Alfa back to \"Nino\".","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":24},{"lap":58,"text":"Unable to do so, on lap 58 he handed the Alfa back to \"Nino\".","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":24},{"lap":70,"text":"Farina makes an extra stop.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":70,"text":"Farina makes an extra stop.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":85,"text":"Near the end Seaman was rapidly closing in on Rosemeyer","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":85,"text":"Near the end Seaman was rapidly closing in on Rosemeyer","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":86,"text":"There were no crashes in the race; Mauri Rose provided the drama by running in sixth place with five laps to go when a balljoint broke.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":14},{"lap":86,"text":"There were no crashes in the race; Mauri Rose provided the drama by running in sixth place with five laps to go when a balljoint broke.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":14},{"lap":89,"text":"Seaman runs out of fuel and has to stop one lap from the finish.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":89,"text":"Seaman runs out of fuel and has to stop one lap from the finish.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":90,"text":"Rosemeyer wins by 50 seconds from Seaman; Mays is third, Farina fifth.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":90,"text":"Mays took third to a standing ovation, well clear of von Delius and Farina, who was driving a newer Alfa than Mays'.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":2},{"lap":90,"text":"Rosemeyer wins by 50 seconds from Seaman; Mays is third, Farina fifth.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":90,"text":"Mays took third to a standing ovation, well clear of von Delius and Farina, who was driving a newer Alfa than Mays'.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":2}]}